(hierarchical_label "INTERFACE_3V3" (shape input) (at 718.82 459.74 180) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right)) (uuid "bf8bdf34-42e6-5921-8942-f921a4b0d737"))
(wire (pts (xy 718.82 459.74) (xy 726.44 459.74)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "32b41830-19c6-59d6-9981-496a0b42df15"))
(label "INTERFACE_3V3" (at 726.44 459.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a1afe130-4bab-5fa2-8f72-7a55e9ce96b8"))
(text "SNES CARTRIDGE-SIDE TRANSLATION AND PROTECTION" (at 20.32 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cf9acf07-120d-5ebf-bc32-768c47444535"))
(text "SN74LVC4245A: A port = 5 V cartridge (VCCA = SNES_5V_CART), B port = 3.3 V FPGA (VCCB = INTERFACE_3V3). DIR/OE are referenced to VCCA (TI SCAS375K). DIR=L: B->A (FPGA drives socket); DIR=H: A->B; OE=H: isolation." (at 20.32 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "73902662-0866-5199-91de-5f37c473556d"))
(text "U201-U206: console outputs, DIR strapped to GND (fixed FPGA->cartridge). U201-U205 share CTL_OE_N_5V (bridge ctl_oe_n); U206 (SYSTEM_CLK + CIC_CLK + CIC_SLAVE_RESET only) has its own CIC_OE_N_5V (sn64_top snes_cic_oe_n, enabled from the sequencer IFACE state).\nU207: D0-D7, DIR and OE both FPGA-controlled (bridge data_dir / data_oe_n). Unused B inputs tied to GND; unused A outputs no-connect." (at 20.32 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "00060d85-28fe-5ca1-913d-fa7d2ff3c04d"))
(text "CARTRIDGE OUTPUT DAMPING: 33 R arrays at the translator A pins (source-series). Values are provisional; tune after SI measurement." (at 20.32 142.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fb0f0478-c466-5784-9288-c869922f2952"))
(text "SENSE + RELEASE PATHS" (at 20.32 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cdc9dc27-b819-57ed-aa1b-5aec5d713f57"))
(text "U209 SN74LVC244A at 3.3 V: 5.5 V-tolerant inputs with Ioff; receives /IRQ, /RESET, EXPAND (CIC data pins use U215/U216).\nU210-U212 74LVC1G07 / U213 74LVC1G06: 3.3 V open-drain outputs (5.5 V tolerant, Ioff) pulled to SNES_5V_CART.\nNo 5 V pull-up reaches an FPGA pin. Interface rail off or FPGA unconfigured => every translator /OE released high (isolated).\n/RESET: Q201 open-drain sink. RESET_GATE_5V pulled to 5 V: cartridge held in reset unless INTERFACE_3V3 is up AND the FPGA drives cart_reset_pull_n=1." (at 20.32 215.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "840197b7-ba85-5d05-b2d7-f210885b02b2"))
(text "/OE and DIR edge timing: the bridge releases the data octet one 46.56 ns clock before turnaround. R203/R204 = 1k keep the passive rising edge short\n(about 10 pF load: tau ~10 ns); R201/R202 2.2k drive five/one /OE inputs where only permit-loss timing matters. Verify on hardware." (at 20.32 312.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "58d00cbc-a4bc-5eee-b7c5-7bfe62b425cd"))
(text "PULL/BIAS: /IRQ, /RESET, EXPAND 10k to cartridge 5 V (OpenSFC keeps pull-ups on IRQ/EXPAND); CIC_DATA0/1 10k pull-downs (R216/R217). Values provisional." (at 20.32 325.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6df41ad6-cc9c-5a9e-8433-3b27fbf88707"))
(text "CIC DATA PINS - PER-PIN DIRECTION CONTROL (J2.55 CIC_DATA0 via U215, J2.24 CIC_DATA1 via U216)" (at 609.6 203.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1eb1d043-e67e-5cab-8dd0-440fa206d79b"))
(text "SN74LVC1T45 (TI SCES515N): A = FPGA side (VCCA = INTERFACE_3V3), B = cartridge side (VCCB = SNES_5V_CART). No shared enable.\nDIR is referenced to VCCA and driven directly by its own FPGA pin cic_dataN_dir: H = A->B (FPGA drives the cartridge), L = B->A (listen).\nFPGA rule (no OE pin, SCES515N 8.2.2): set DIR high BEFORE driving cic_dataN; switch cic_dataN to input BEFORE setting DIR low.\nIdle: R216/R217 10k cartridge-side pull-down (lock expects released = low); R218/R219 100k A-side pull-down (same condition both sides);\nR220/R221 10k DIR pull-down (FPGA unconfigured = listen); R214/R215 33R series. Ioff + VCC isolation: either rail at GND => both ports high-Z." (at 609.6 208.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fbc74527-b1be-53d3-b81e-e30eb95fae3d"))
(text "DECOUPLING: one 100 nF per supply pin (place at the pin) plus one 10 uF bulk per rail." (at 20.32 401.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "895be16e-0aa3-5368-96d5-0c14fbdf5280"))
(text "AUDIO: AUDIO_L_IN / AUDIO_R_IN pass untouched (no digital translation); test points only." (at 406.4 340.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e144d540-4c75-552e-b5e8-33b7934a4000"))
(text "HIERARCHICAL PORTS - CARTRIDGE SIDE (root J2 net labels)" (at 543.56 317.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top)) (uuid "068a6d44-be31-56b6-b30c-7dab0fedb0e5"))
(text "PENDING PORTS - FPGA SIDE (bridge port names) + DEFAULT-OFF RAILS FROM FUTURE POWER SHEET" (at 690.88 317.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top)) (uuid "44f82413-bee4-54cc-9d43-e5061af81e00"))
(text "DRAFT 0.3.1-cart: schematic circuit candidate only. No PCB, SI simulation, power sequencing test, ESD part or cartridge test has been performed.\nSNES_5V_CART and INTERFACE_3V3 are hierarchical inputs from the (future) power sheet; #FLG201/#FLG202 mark them externally supplied for ERC only.\nOpen: socket ESD array selection, final damping/pull values (CIC pull-down value to confirm against a real key CIC).\nSources: TI SCAS375K (SN74LVC4245A), SCAS414AG (SN74LVC244A), SCES296AG (SN74LVC1G07), SCES295AB (SN74LVC1G06), SCES515N (SN74LVC1T45).\nSee docs/design/cart-interface-schematic.md." (at 20.32 525.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b75a3aa9-ee5f-58a1-a371-72e17d689283"))
